                        Worcestershire. Benedictine cathedral priory of St Mary the Virgin</orgName><p>'Liber domini humfridi Weblei monachi Wygor' Scrutinium diuinæ
                        scripturæ ab eodem authore editum (on back pastedown). Fragments of another
                        book of Webley's forms the flyleaves of Oxford, Bodleian, printed book 8o
                        M.122 Th (q.v.).</p></provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">'Codex Thomae Blissei barbitonsoris Regalis
